          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wahosheli naMosi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nindi, Wakatuŋi mbashila yawuneŋu, niitentaminu dayu dakekali dawuneŋu, kulonda kuwelelamu; wakayishihakachi, hela itenti dakubulakena iku kameŋa nawa iku, wakashumu nimeji.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kunuŋaku nawa, Yehova wahosheli cheŋi naMosi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nindi, Tambulaku nyitondu yepukaŋa mavumba amawahi abadika, nimora yakweŋamanji jishekeli makulakaji atanu, nisinamoni yanunka chachiwahi yakwesekaneyi muhafu, dimu mujishekeli makulakaji ayedi namakumi atanu, ninyisachiyanunka chachiwahi jishekeli makulakaji ayedi namakumi atanu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wahosheli cheŋi naMosi, nindi, Tambulaku nyitondu yepukaŋa mavumba amawahi, niweŋu wanunka chachiwahi, nichecheleti, nichelibena; hinyitondu yepukapa mavumba amawahi yakubomba nalibona ditooka to-o; kweseka yejima pezu yoyimu hohu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wakeli nachu insensi, hiyuma yakubombabomba chachiwahi yevumba dadiwahi mwomwelaŋayi muntuwaheta maana akubombabomba mavumba, akashuku nimuŋwa, yakeliyitooka to-o, yajila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakanonuhu yi kwawu wakayitwi puchi-puchi, wakashi kumesu awunsahu mwitenti dakubulakena kwokunakabulakena neyi; kudenu yakekali yajila nankashi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bayi mwakadilila enu aweni insensi yakubombabomba chochinaku; kudeyi yakekali yajila yambalaya Yehova hohu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yowu muntu wakela yidi chochina kulonda kununkaku, akamufumishi mudi antaŋa jindi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
